0:{"buildId":"7TV3WSDnKGdgKVGmLMU3E","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Destinations"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"What are the common myths of studying abroad? Myths Busted !"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Many of us wish to study in other countries. The prospect of walking into a foreign university campus and experiencing a new country is both terrifying and thrilling. Many people have the opportunity to realise their dreams and achieve a lot, but other people never try. It’s difficult to make such a momentous decision, and these typical study abroad myths don’t help. We’ve refuted the most common ones to clear the air. Scroll down and debunk these common myths of studying abroad with us!"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","The guide",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"The guide"}],[["$","p","Studying abroad is just too expensive!",{"children":"Studying abroad is just too expensive!"}],["$","p","Whether you’re studying locally or across the globe, you can expect to spend a lot of money. Well, that is what most people think when they first come across the term “",{"children":"Whether you’re studying locally or across the globe, you can expect to spend a lot of money. Well, that is what most people think when they first come across the term “"}],["$","p","Studying Abroad.",{"children":"Studying Abroad."}],["$","p","” The good news is that international education is growing more popular, and more financial aid options are becoming available, as well as countries that provide low-cost education. One of the most common misconceptions about studying abroad is that you must have a solid financial background.",{"children":"” The good news is that international education is growing more popular, and more financial aid options are becoming available, as well as countries that provide low-cost education. One of the most common misconceptions about studying abroad is that you must have a solid financial background."}],["$","p","Even though it may appear to be one of the most difficult aspects of studying abroad, many institutions now provide scholarships specifically for international students. It’s only a matter of scouting them out and signing up for them. Inquire about any additional scholarships that may be available from the foreign department of the university you desire to attend. Contact One Window now to know more about such financial aids and give your dreams the boost that they deserve.",{"children":"Even though it may appear to be one of the most difficult aspects of studying abroad, many institutions now provide scholarships specifically for international students. It’s only a matter of scouting them out and signing up for them. Inquire about any additional scholarships that may be available from the foreign department of the university you desire to attend. Contact One Window now to know more about such financial aids and give your dreams the boost that they deserve."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}],["$","section","Studying in a new country requires you to learn a new language",{"children":["$L5",["$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld"],"$Le"]}],"$Lf","$L10"]}],"$L11"]}]}],"$L12"]}],["$L13"],"$L14"]}],"isPartial":"$@15","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L17","isPartial":"$@18","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L19","isPartial":"$@1a","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":"$1b"},{"rsc":"$L1c","isPartial":"$@1d","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":"$1b"},{"rsc":"$L1e","isPartial":"$@1f","staleTime":"$16","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@20","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@21"}
