5:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Studying in a new country requires you to learn a new language"}]
6:["$","p","When it comes to foreign programmes, this fallacious myth is often cited as one of the most difficult aspects of studying abroad, but our study abroad statistics prove otherwise! You’re probably thinking of taking an English-taught course when you travel overseas. So, in most circumstances, learning the native language of the country (if it isn’t English) isn’t necessary.",{"children":"When it comes to foreign programmes, this fallacious myth is often cited as one of the most difficult aspects of studying abroad, but our study abroad statistics prove otherwise! You’re probably thinking of taking an English-taught course when you travel overseas. So, in most circumstances, learning the native language of the country (if it isn’t English) isn’t necessary."}]
7:["$","p","Because most foreign colleges place a strong emphasis on attracting international students, English-taught programmes are becoming increasingly widespread. Having said that, even knowing a few basic phrases in the native language of that country can provide you with a far more real study abroad experience, allowing you to immerse yourself deeper in the culture and communicate with people more confidently.",{"children":"Because most foreign colleges place a strong emphasis on attracting international students, English-taught programmes are becoming increasingly widespread. Having said that, even knowing a few basic phrases in the native language of that country can provide you with a far more real study abroad experience, allowing you to immerse yourself deeper in the culture and communicate with people more confidently."}]
8:["$","p","You can’t study abroad if you are an introvert.",{"children":"You can’t study abroad if you are an introvert."}]
9:["$","p","It will motivate you to open up if you are an introvert. Communication skills will improve as a result of meeting strangers and developing friends.",{"children":"It will motivate you to open up if you are an introvert. Communication skills will improve as a result of meeting strangers and developing friends."}]
a:["$","p","It has nothing to do with being an introvert when it comes to studying abroad. It’s not even close to being handicapped. When it comes to interacting, introverts are quite capable. Many people, especially when they travel overseas, become extroverts in no time.",{"children":"It has nothing to do with being an introvert when it comes to studying abroad. It’s not even close to being handicapped. When it comes to interacting, introverts are quite capable. Many people, especially when they travel overseas, become extroverts in no time."}]
b:["$","p","Studying abroad is a free pass to party hard in a foreign country!",{"children":"Studying abroad is a free pass to party hard in a foreign country!"}]
c:["$","p","It all comes down to studying, learning, and honing vital abilities. Without a doubt, some students regard studying abroad as a holiday, to party, drink, and hook up with other students. Some programmes are more akin to glorified holidays, transporting busloads of international students from one attraction to the next. But times have changed, and studying abroad has become so much more. It broadens one’s horizons while also providing a plethora of personal and professional changes. While it should be enjoyable, it is also a serious undertaking that will test pupils on a personal level and affect their academic careers. Studying abroad entails enrolling in classes, preferably given by local academics on topics that are relevant to the area — and, if feasible, in the local language.",{"children":"It all comes down to studying, learning, and honing vital abilities. Without a doubt, some students regard studying abroad as a holiday, to party, drink, and hook up with other students. Some programmes are more akin to glorified holidays, transporting busloads of international students from one attraction to the next. But times have changed, and studying abroad has become so much more. It broadens one’s horizons while also providing a plethora of personal and professional changes. While it should be enjoyable, it is also a serious undertaking that will test pupils on a personal level and affect their academic careers. Studying abroad entails enrolling in classes, preferably given by local academics on topics that are relevant to the area — and, if feasible, in the local language."}]
d:["$","p","Students will study various educational systems and instructional methods. Once they’ve had an opportunity to see things from a different perspective, they’ll find themselves questioning their opinions and notions. Students will learn to respect diverse cultures and solve challenges in an environment that is different from their own.",{"children":"Students will study various educational systems and instructional methods. Once they’ve had an opportunity to see things from a different perspective, they’ll find themselves questioning their opinions and notions. Students will learn to respect diverse cultures and solve challenges in an environment that is different from their own."}]
e:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
f:["$","section","[content_block id=14313 slug=zoho-form]",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"[content_block id=14313 slug=zoho-form]"}],[["$","p","Studying abroad is not safe anymore.",{"children":"Studying abroad is not safe anymore."}],["$","p","Well, have you ever been the street and out of nowhere seen people tripping over, walking in your drawing room where you have been forever and still getting your feet to get hit by the leg of the sofa, well I have and trust me when I say this, no place is safe if that is something you are afraid of? It’s a big bad world out there and you have to step out and face it.",{"children":"Well, have you ever been the street and out of nowhere seen people tripping over, walking in your drawing room where you have been forever and still getting your feet to get hit by the leg of the sofa, well I have and trust me when I say this, no place is safe if that is something you are afraid of? It’s a big bad world out there and you have to step out and face it."}],["$","p","Don’t allow that to keep you from discovering a whole new world and gaining access to a wealth of information.",{"children":"Don’t allow that to keep you from discovering a whole new world and gaining access to a wealth of information."}],["$","p","Employers don’t pay much attention to whether you had studied abroad or not.",{"children":"Employers don’t pay much attention to whether you had studied abroad or not."}],["$","p","Studying abroad can help you develop some of the most employable skills.",{"children":"Studying abroad can help you develop some of the most employable skills."}],["$","p","Employers are increasingly looking for personnel that are culturally aware and can communicate in another language. Of course, there are many ways to acquire these skills, but studying abroad will allow you to not only improve in these areas, but also to gain marketable international qualifications, demonstrate your ability to work with a diverse range of people, and demonstrate that you dare to move to a new location and challenge yourself.",{"children":"Employers are increasingly looking for personnel that are culturally aware and can communicate in another language. Of course, there are many ways to acquire these skills, but studying abroad will allow you to not only improve in these areas, but also to gain marketable international qualifications, demonstrate your ability to work with a diverse range of people, and demonstrate that you dare to move to a new location and challenge yourself."}],["$","p","However, you cannot simply state on your CV that you “study overseas.” You must demonstrate and market yourself to potential employers, outlining what you learned, how the experience made you a better person, and how this would affect the ideas you have for a new career.",{"children":"However, you cannot simply state on your CV that you “study overseas.” You must demonstrate and market yourself to potential employers, outlining what you learned, how the experience made you a better person, and how this would affect the ideas you have for a new career."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
10:["$","section","Let us know if you have any questions about studying abroad, you can avail a",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Let us know if you have any questions about studying abroad, you can avail a"}],[["$","p","FREE !! 30 Minute session with Our STUDY ABROAD education Counsellors",{"children":"FREE !! 30 Minute session with Our STUDY ABROAD education Counsellors"}],["$","p",".",{"children":"."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
